data: {"type":"response.output_text.done","content_index":0,"item_id":"msg_8a9f3b6979d1fe68006a51bc70838481908565574d1024c4ec","logprobs":[],"output_index":2,"sequence_number":452,"text":"The available documentation describes one Contoso product in detail: **SmartView Glasses** by **Contoso Galaxy Innovations**, in the **Smart Eyewear** category .\n\n## SmartView Glasses (Contoso Galaxy Innovations) — features\nSmartView Glasses are positioned as augmented-reality smart eyewear with a mix of AR, AI, recording, and eye-protection capabilities :\n\n- **Augmented Reality (AR) interface** for interactive overlays and experiences   \n- **Voice-controlled AI agent** for hands-free control and assistance   \n- **HD video recording with 3D audio** to capture video along with spatial audio   \n- **UV protection and blue light filtering** for eye safety and comfort in different lighting conditions   \n- **Wireless charging with extended battery life** to reduce downtime and improve portability   \n\n## What the documentation includes (user guide topics)\nThe user guide outlines these sections for setup, usage, and ongoing care :\n\n1. **Introduction** (getting started with SmartView Glasses)   \n2. **Product overview** (features and controls)   \n3. **Sizing and fit** (fit and style adjustments)   \n4. **Care and maintenance** (cleaning/care)   \n5. **Break-in period** (adjusting to the AR experience)   \n6. **Safety tips** (public/private space guidelines)   \n7. **Troubleshooting** (common fixes)   \n\n## Warranty, returns, and support\n- **Warranty:** two-year limited warranty on electronic components   \n- **Return policy:** 30-day returns, “no questions asked”   \n- **Support contact:** support@contoso-galaxy-innovations.com   \n\n## FAQ topics covered\nThe FAQ includes help on:\n- syncing SmartView Glasses with devices,\n- troubleshooting connection issues,\n- customizing the AR environment   \n\nIf you have more Contoso product docs (or a catalog) you want included, upload them and I’ll expand this into a full “Contoso products” rundown."}

