data: {"type":"response.output_text.done","content_index":0,"item_id":"msg_8a9f3b6979d1fe68006a51bc7c19c08190850b99a940f3b3f2","logprobs":[],"output_index":1,"sequence_number":261,"text":"**Smart Eyewear** (in the provided Contoso documentation) refers to **SmartView Glasses** from **Contoso Galaxy Innovations** . It’s eyewear that combines AR, hands-free AI control, media capture, eye protection, and convenient power features.\n\n### Key Smart Eyewear features\n- **Augmented Reality (AR) interface**: Provides an AR experience through the glasses, enabling digital overlays and interactive content in your view .  \n- **Voice-controlled AI agent**: Built-in AI that you control by voice for hands-free operation .  \n- **HD video recording with 3D audio**: Captures high-definition video paired with spatial (3D) audio .  \n- **UV protection + blue light filtering**: Adds traditional eyewear-style eye protection, including filtering blue light .  \n- **Wireless charging with extended battery life**: Supports wireless charging and is designed for longer use between charges .  \n\n### What else is covered in the documentation\nThe Smart Eyewear user guide also includes sections on **product overview/controls, sizing & fit, care & maintenance, a break-in period for adjusting to AR, safety tips, and troubleshooting** ."}

